* [[http://am.renesas.com/products/tools/introductory_evaluation_tools/renesas_starter_kits/rsk_rx210/index.jsp] RX210 Starter Kit]
*[[http://am.renesas.com/products/tools/ide/ide_hew/index.jsp] Renesas High-performance Embedded Workshop ]

